Metrics List:
- {"name": "container_ulimits_soft", "type": "gauge", "description": "Soft ulimit values for the container root process."}
- {"name": "container_fs_usage_bytes", "type": "gauge", "description": "Number of bytes that are consumed by the container on this filesystem."}
- {"name": "container_spec_memory_limit_bytes", "type": "gauge", "description": "Memory limit for the container."}
- {"name": "container_fs_limit_bytes", "type": "gauge", "description": "Number of bytes that can be consumed by the container on this filesystem."}
- {"name": "container_memory_usage_bytes", "type": "gauge", "description": "Current memory usage in bytes, including all memory regardless of when it was accessed"}
Question: Show the filesystem usage and limit bytes for all containers of the auth service.

Metrics List:
- {"name": "node_filefd_maximum", "type": "gauge", "description": "File descriptor statistics: maximum."}
- {"name": "node_filefd_allocated", "type": "gauge", "description": "File descriptor statistics: allocated."}
- {"name": "container_sockets", "type": "gauge", "description": "Number of open sockets for the container."}
- {"name": "node_filesystem_files", "type": "gauge", "description": "Filesystem total file nodes."}
- {"name": "node_filesystem_files_free", "type": "gauge", "description": "Filesystem total free file nodes."}
- {"name": "node_memory_Inactive_file_bytes", "type": "gauge", "description": "Memory information field Inactive_file_bytes."}
- {"name": "node_memory_Active_file_bytes", "type": "gauge", "description": "Memory information field Active_file_bytes."}
- {"name": "container_fs_inodes_total", "type": "gauge", "description": "Number of Inodes"}
- {"name": "machine_cpu_sockets", "type": "gauge", "description": "Number of CPU sockets."}
- {"name": "container_fs_inodes_free", "type": "gauge", "description": "Number of available Inodes"}
Question: Perform a linear prediction of the number of open file descriptors on k8s-node1 and k8s-node2, respectively, based on the last hour's data and predicting forward for the next four hours.
